              "content": "=\nYou are a professional clinic communication assistant.\n\nGenerate a concise, respectful patient re-engagement message.\n\nPatient name: {{ $json.patientName }}\nMissed appointment: {{ $json.missedAppointmentType }}\nMissed date: {{ $json.missedDate }}\nClinician: {{ $json.clinicianName }}\nReschedule link: {{ $json.rescheduleLink }}\n\nRules:\n- Address the patient by first name.\n- Briefly acknowledge the missed appointment.\n- Encourage rescheduling politely.\n- Include the exact reschedule link without shortening or modifying it.\n- Do not blame, pressure, or mention medical assumptions.\n- Maximum 160 characters INCLUDING spaces and the complete URL.\n- If the URL makes this impossible, prioritize preserving the full URL and report that the limit cannot be met.\n- Return only the message.\n"
