        "message": "=\n<h2>Missed Appointment – Approval Required</h2>\n\n<p>Hello Manager,</p>\n\n<p>A patient missed their scheduled appointment. Please review the AI-generated follow-up message below.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><strong>Patient Name:</strong> {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.patientName }}</p>\n\n<p><strong>Patient ID:</strong> {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.patientId }}</p>\n\n<p><strong>Appointment:</strong> {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.missedAppointmentType }}</p>\n\n<p><strong>Missed Date:</strong> {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.missedDate }}</p>\n\n<p><strong>Clinician:</strong> {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.clinicianName }}</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>Proposed Message</h3>\n\n<p>{{ $('Message a model').first().json.content[0].text }}</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>Please review the message and choose an action:</p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"{{ $execution.resumeUrl }}&decision=approve\">APPROVE MESSAGE</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"{{ $execution.resumeUrl }}&decision=reject\">REJECT MESSAGE</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n",
